# ERD Diagram Placeholder

This file is a placeholder for the Entity Relationship Diagram.

To create the actual ERD diagram, you can use tools like:
- MySQL Workbench
- draw.io
- Lucidchart
- dbdiagram.io

The database schema is defined in:
- database/schema.sql (DDL)
- database/data.sql (DML with sample data)

Key entities and relationships:
- users (1) ----< orders (many)
- categories (1) ----< products (many)
- products (1) ----< order_items (many)
- orders (1) ----< order_items (many)
- users (1) ----< cart (many)
- products (1) ----< cart (many)
